  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRChat 2024.2.2 Added localization functionality for the first time\n\nBut I think there are some problems\n\nIn the Chinese translation, Physbones is translated as \"动骨\"\n\nIn the old version of the game, this type of bones used unity paid components (Dynamic Bone)\n\nDynamic means \"动态; 动力学; 动力\" in Chinese\n\nBut I think the term is very unfamiliar and ambiguous to the average gamer\n\nFor example, it is misunderstood as \"会动的骨骼\" (moving bones)\n\nBut the original meaning of \"Physbones\" should be \"物理骨骼\"(physical bones)\n\nSo I think \"动骨\" is a legacy term, but it doesn't fit here\n\nIf it translated as \"动态骨骼; 物理骨骼\" i think will be better\n\nAt the same time, Texture Memory should be better translated as \"显存占用\"\n\nUsing \"贴图占用\" may be ambiguous as the size occupied by the texture in the downloaded file",
